{"mainQuestId":75651,"title":"An Honest Promotion","description":"\"Buy one get one free! My loss if you buy, your loss if you don't!\"\\nBut what sort of gullible folk would be taken in by such slogans... Wait, Paimon pre-ordered already?","titleTextMapHash":3774929295,"descTextMapHash":1450265606,"mainQuestExcel":{"mainQuestId":75651,"titleTextMapHash":3774929295,"title":"An Honest Promotion","descTextMapHash":1450265606,"description":"\"Buy one get one free! My loss if you buy, your loss if you don't!\"\\nBut what sort of gullible folk would be taken in by such slogans... Wait, Paimon pre-ordered already?","chapterId":0,"mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","activityId":5205,"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ75651","mainQuestRaw":{"activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","activityId":5205,"chapterId":0,"descTextMapHash":1450265606,"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GMENNHMBBOH":[{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0}],"id":75651,"IELNANBAMLH":"QUEST_PAUSE_RES_DESTROY_NONE","IGHALKGCHAB":554370633,"LEFIHLHODBM":[],"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ75651","mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","MHHFFHCLDKI":false,"PEDANLIDLGE":0,"PEFIFLDHPEE":false,"recommendLevel":0,"repeatable":false,"resId":0,"rewardIdList":[175651],"series":0,"showRedPoint":true,"showType":"QUEST_SHOW","specialShowCondIdList":[],"specialShowQuestId":0,"specialShowRewardId":[],"suggestTrackMainQuestList":[],"suggestTrackOutOfOrder":false,"taskID":0,"titleTextMapHash":3774929295,"type":"WQ","unlockDescTextMapHash":3414717494}},"flow":[{"subQuestId":7565101,"order":1,"stepDescription":"Take a walk with Paimon","stepDescTextMapHash":3960281604,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7565101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5026"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7565101],"talks":[{"talkId":7565101,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7565101","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7565101,"initDialog":756510101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[5026],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75651/Q7565101","priority":5,"questId":75651,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":756510101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3510930986,"text":"#Y'know, {NICKNAME}, Paimon can see that the commissions have been pretty taxing lately.","nextNodeIds":[756510102]},{"nodeId":756510102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3099975210,"text":"As a thoughtful, capable guide, Paimon's duty is to help you relax, so... Ta-da! Guess where this is?","nextNodeIds":[756510103,756510105]},{"nodeId":756510103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2831490738,"text":"Well, it says \"Damoville Purveyor\" on the sign right here.","nextNodeIds":[756510104]},{"nodeId":756510105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2127887690,"text":"Ah, the abode of Mora thieves, the graveyard of wallets.","nextNodeIds":[756510106]},{"nodeId":756510104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5026,"speakerName":"Boucicaut","textMapHash":2842812866,"text":"Hello there. Welcome to Damoville Purveyor.","nextNodeIds":[756510107]},{"nodeId":756510106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5026,"speakerName":"Boucicaut","textMapHash":3647323738,"text":"Dear me, dear customer, do not speak such inaccuracies. Damoville Purveyor is committed wholly to affordability and quality. You may survey our prices should you wish.","nextNodeIds":[756510107]},{"nodeId":756510107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3138213314,"text":"This is no ordinary store. This is a place where hardworking laborers relax via spending money.","nextNodeIds":[756510108]},{"nodeId":756510108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5026,"speakerName":"Boucicaut","textMapHash":292343146,"text":"Indeed, indeed! In fact, we have recently launched a buy one get one free promotion, with all customers welcome to take part!","nextNodeIds":[756510109]},{"nodeId":756510109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5026,"speakerName":"Boucicaut","textMapHash":2464692114,"text":"My loss if you buy, your loss if you don't!","nextNodeIds":[756510110]},{"nodeId":756510110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2724622290,"text":"Hehe, Paimon saw the event poster when we passed by before. That's how she remembered it.","nextNodeIds":[756510111]},{"nodeId":756510111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2027588378,"text":"Double the goods for every purchase sounds like a great deal, no matter how you slice it!","nextNodeIds":[756510112]},{"nodeId":756510112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3419778282,"text":"It always feels like there's something missing in Paimon's day if she doesn't spend some Mora here... So today, we're coming here together to fill that gap!","nextNodeIds":[756510113,756510114]},{"nodeId":756510113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1675416634,"text":"And what would you like to buy, Paimon?","nextNodeIds":[756510115]},{"nodeId":756510114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1483407202,"text":"And how shall this yawning void be filled, Paimon?","nextNodeIds":[756510115]},{"nodeId":756510115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1158885698,"text":"Hehe, not telling you just yet.","nextNodeIds":[756510116]},{"nodeId":756510116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3959304866,"text":"Payment might get tricky that way.","nextNodeIds":[756510117]},{"nodeId":756510117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2543859658,"text":"Nah, don't worry. Paimon brought her own Mora today.","nextNodeIds":[756510118]},{"nodeId":756510118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1944118050,"text":"#Boss, has the order arrived yet? It's under \"Paimon and {NICKNAME}.\"","nextNodeIds":[756510119]},{"nodeId":756510119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5026,"speakerName":"Boucicaut","textMapHash":777793522,"text":"We do have your package. One moment...","nextNodeIds":[756510120]},{"nodeId":756510120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3637860362,"text":"Boucicaut the shopkeeper retrieves something over-packaged beyond identification. Beside you, Paimon fishes out a large pile of pocket money. You detect a hint of sadness on her face as she parts with this sizable sum.","nextNodeIds":[756510121]},{"nodeId":756510121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1903831082,"text":"After you unwrap the package together, you realize that it contains two photo albums.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":756510122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":268011978,"text":"Hehe, finally! Paimon's been waiting ages to get these!","nextNodeIds":[756510123]},{"nodeId":756510123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2533050362,"text":"We've taken so many pictures so far, and now we've got a spot to put them!","nextNodeIds":[756510124]},{"nodeId":756510124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":355143066,"text":"I don't usually see you use a Kamera?","nextNodeIds":[756510125]},{"nodeId":756510125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4056688970,"text":"Hehe, that doesn't mean Paimon hasn't ever whipped it out! She's taken quite a few pictures of you while you weren't looking, in fact!","nextNodeIds":[756510126,756510127]},{"nodeId":756510126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":308806170,"text":"Huh. Y'know, I'd like to see 'em now...","nextNodeIds":[756510128]},{"nodeId":756510127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1285276370,"text":"Ooh, let me see!","nextNodeIds":[756510128]},{"nodeId":756510128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2514621482,"text":"Not right now! Paimon's gotta take a whole album's worth first.","nextNodeIds":[756510129,756510130]},{"nodeId":756510129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":599279954,"text":"Nyeh, so petty.","nextNodeIds":[756510131]},{"nodeId":756510130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2510190194,"text":"Paimon's a meanie.","nextNodeIds":[756510131]},{"nodeId":756510131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2550580394,"text":"Pfft, phooey! Anyway, take this photo album, would'ja?","nextNodeIds":[756510132]},{"nodeId":756510132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3014691714,"text":"This one's a little thin, but it can fit a whole bunch of photos anyway.","nextNodeIds":[756510133]},{"nodeId":756510133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1460143146,"text":"We've been to so many places and taken many photos for others, but not really for ourselves.","nextNodeIds":[756510134]},{"nodeId":756510134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1923763882,"text":"Paimon thought it'd be nice if we could keep a few more memories for ourselves, so she bought these two albums.","nextNodeIds":[756510135]},{"nodeId":756510135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3512810634,"text":"So this is a gift?","nextNodeIds":[756510136]},{"nodeId":756510136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1368014698,"text":"That's right. It was a buy one get one free deal, so it's one for each of us. Paimon had it all figured out even when she was ordering.","nextNodeIds":[756510137]},{"nodeId":756510137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1790338802,"text":"You've gotta start using it right away, alright? You can take pictures of places we've been to, maybe relive some past memories as well.","nextNodeIds":[756510138]},{"nodeId":756510138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3846802618,"text":"By the way, wanna use Paimon's Kamera to take some photos? You've never used it before, right?","nextNodeIds":[756510139]},{"nodeId":756510139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3643724882,"text":"It took a lot of effort to custom-order this from a department store, so it'd be a shame if we didn't use it more often.","nextNodeIds":[756510140,756510141]},{"nodeId":756510140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3990863282,"text":"Sure, I'll give it a go.","nextNodeIds":[756510142]},{"nodeId":756510141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":674776386,"text":"Thanks, Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[756510142]},{"nodeId":756510142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3289358738,"text":"Hehe, as long as you like it! This is what a good guide should do, after all.","nextNodeIds":[756510143]},{"nodeId":756510143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1102702266,"text":"C'mon! Let's go take some photos!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[